Huntsman's house is severe and serious, the same as his owner. There is a large copper ring, fastened in grinned iron jaws. Those who are not acquainted with Beobras may by disinclined to come in, only by the sight of the house. Truly, appearances are deceptive. Beobras is a good-natured person; he is frightening only to enemies of Mech-City. You come up to the door and seize the ring.